From 49eaf1493d6c63e38c7372696033118128003210 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LiveWallpaper Dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:58:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Tauri v2 + Svelte-TS live wallpaper app for Windows

- Svelte 5 + Vite + TypeScript frontend with a flow-field canvas animation
- Tauri v2 Rust backend embeds the webview behind desktop icons (WorkerW,
  with fallback to Progman for Windows 11 24H2+)
- System tray with Pause/Resume and Quit
- Bundle targets: NSIS (.exe) and WiX (.msi)
