@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# LiveWallpaper (Tauri v2 + Svelte 5 + TypeScript + Rust)
+
+Animated desktop wallpaper for Windows. The Tauri webview is re-parented into
+Explorer's `WorkerW` window so it renders behind the desktop icons.
+
+## Requirements (Windows 10/11)
+
+- Node.js 20+
+- Rust (MSVC toolchain): https://rustup.rs
+- Visual Studio Build Tools with "Desktop development with C++"
+- WebView2 Runtime (preinstalled on Windows 11)
+
+## Develop
+
+```powershell
+npm install
+npm run dev          # frontend only, in the browser
+npm run tauri:dev    # full app: wallpaper is attached behind the icons
+```
+
+Quit from the tray icon (Pause / Resume, Quit).
+
+## Build installers
+
+```powershell
+npm run tauri:build
+```
+
+Output in `src-tauri/target/release/bundle/`:
+
+- `nsis/LiveWallpaper_0.1.0_x64-setup.exe`
+- `msi/LiveWallpaper_0.1.0_x64_en-US.msi`
+
+Replace the placeholder icons with your own: `npm run tauri icon path/to/logo.png`.
